Completed Work
The simulator currently implements the following 10 instructions: MOV A, #data, MOV A, #data,ADD A, #data,SUBB A, #data, INC A, DEC A, MUL AB, ANL A, #data,
SJMP rel, HALT.
The CPU core has been implemented with:Registers R0–R7, Accumulator A, Register B, Program Counter PC, Stack Pointer SP, Program Status Word PSW, Carry (CY), Auxiliary Carry (AC), 
and Overflow (OV) flags, Program memory, Data memory.
FETCH → DECODE → EXECUTE has been implemented.
A basic Java Swing user interface has been implemented.

